      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Elite Estate Agents are delighted to present this beautifully refurbished ground-floor, two-bedroom apartment to the residential sales market. Situated in the highly sought-after Stradbrook development, this superb home offers stylish, modern living in a prime location.\n\nThe refurbishment has been completed to an exceptional standard and includes a bespoke fitted kitchen with floor-to-ceiling storage, a custom-designed media unit in the living room offering extensive storage, fully refurbished bathrooms, new flooring throughout, and a host of additional high-quality finishes.\n\n\nOutside \nLarge outside terrace, covered\nUnderground carpark with entrance and exits on Stradbally and Dublin Road \nFob and App Access to Carpark and Building \n\nServices \nGas central heating "
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (21.98ft x 6.56ft) Wood effect tiles, two substantial storage areas, light fitting <br>Kitchen/Dining/Living Area (24.28ft x 19.03ft) What a stunning new Kitchen - wood effect floor tiling throughout, bespoke fitted kitchen (2 years old) with floor to ceiling storage, clever and abundant storage, kitchen island, double wall oven, stylish and modern carpentry and cabinet hardware. The kitchen is a stand out feature of this apartment. \n\nKitchen - 5.5m x 2.4m\nDining and Living Area - 7.4m x 3.3m<br>Master Bedroom (18.04ft x 9.19ft) Carpet flooring, fitted sliding mirrored wardrobes, roller blind, light fitting <br>En-suite (5.91ft x 5.25ft) Refurbished ensuite bathroom tiled floor to ceiling with a mixture of vinyl tiling, new corner shower unit, sink with vanity unit, mirrored storage cupboard, heated towel rail, light fitting <br>Bedroom 2 (18.04ft x 8.53ft) Carpet flooring, fitted sliding mirrored wardrobes, roller blind, light fitting <br>Main Bathroom (5.91ft x 6.56ft) Stunning bathroom space - beautiful cream floor and wall tiles refurbished with Balmoral freestanding right hand shower bath with chrome claw and ball feet, new hand wash basin in vanity unit, WC, light fitting "
